# a kit's EDIT pages: a black key picks the key shown (and plays it, stopped); the white keys put it on the bar's
# steps, again takes it off, as Steps does. With EDIT held, or while recording, the white keys play the kit
wait 300
expect trk 1
tap EDIT
expect page Engine
tapkey b1
expect note 1 1 6 0
tapkey w5
expect note 1 1 6 2
tapkey w5
expect note 1 1 6 0
turn SELECT 1
wait 40
tapkey w7
expect note 1 1 8 2
press EDIT
tapkey w9
release EDIT
expect note 1 1 10 0
shot kitedit.png
